  "notes": "Sprint 139 Task 023 — Worker Honest Self-Assessment Runtime Check integration testleri yazıldı.\n\n## Yapılanlar\n\n### 8 yeni integration test — tests/agents/worker.test.ts\nYeni `describe` bloğu: 'verify-delta: end-to-end honest self-assessment chain'\n\n1. **full chain: DONE worker with 100% completion stays DONE through both layers** — writeVerifyDeltaBaseline → computeVerifyDelta → applyTechDebtDowngrade tam zinciri; DONE kararı korunuyor.\n\n2. **full chain: Sprint 137 regression** — worker 0 dosya değiştirdi, 76 test hatasını düzeltmedi; Layer 1 NO_GO yakalıyor, Layer 2 (applyTechDebtDowngrade) DONE → NO_GO upgrade ediyor. Sprint 137 gerçek vaka.\n\n3. **full chain: partial completion 60%** — 3/5 dosya, testRatio=1, completionRatio=0.76; DONE → GO_WITH_TECH_DEBT downgrade.\n\n4. **full chain: GO_WITH_TECH_DEBT + ratio<50% escalated to NO_GO** — çift katman doğrulama.\n\n5. **verify-delta baseline file written to correct path with correct JSON schema** — dosya adı ve JSON format doğrulaması.\n\n6. **computeVerifyDelta returns null when baseline file was never written** — edge case: baseline yokken null döner.\n\n7. **exact boundary: completionRatio === 0.8 is treated as DONE** — float boundary testi (0.6 + 0.4*0.5 = 0.8).\n\n8. **newly introduced test failures cause NO_GO even with file changes** — testRatio=0 penaltı; 0.36 completionRatio → NO_GO.\n\n## Verify Sonuçları\n- `tsc --noEmit`: test dosyalarında 0 hata (sprint-finalizer.ts'teki mevcut pre-existing hata scope dışı)\n- `npx vitest run tests/agents/worker.test.ts tests/orchestra/result-evaluator.test.ts`: 234 tests passed (104 + 130)\n- Baseline: worker.test.ts 96 test → 104 test (+8 yeni)\n\n## Honest Self-Assessment\n- Baseline: 96 test (worker.test.ts), 0 failing\n- End state: 104 test, 0 failing\n- Delta: 8 integration test eklendi, tüm senaryolar kapsanıyor (≥80%)\n- Task spec: 5+ integration test → 8 test ✓",
